或退职官僚。中西交往之后，该词被作为英语gentleman的意译之一（另译为“君子”）。彬彬有礼,待人谦和，衣冠得体，谈吐高雅，自身修养，知识渊博，见多识广，有爱心，尊老爱幼，尊重女性，无不良嗜好，人际关系良好。是心地善良、举止优雅的男士。　　绅士风度是西方国家公众，特别是英国男性公众所崇尚的基本礼仪规范。经要求在公众交往中注意自己的仪容举止，风姿优雅，能给人留下彬彬有礼和富有教养的印象。", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "35016": {"data": {"tag_id": 35016, "tag_name": "赵四", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "227640": {"data": {"tag_id": 227640, "tag_name": "鸟叔", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "68": {"data": {"tag_id": 68, "tag_name": "鬼畜", "cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5f42290e9299eceb7dfce4b932b497d1255ea847.jpg", "head_cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/af941ccd50c12c1ccd91869bfcc6fb22d71b458f.png", "content": "起源于NICONICO动画，由最早出现的音MAD《最终鬼畜妹フランドール・S》中的“鬼畜”略称而得名。", "short_content": "以音频调教创作为主体的二次创作", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "32811": {"data": {"tag_id": 32811, "tag_name": "赵本山", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "91925701": {"data": {"tag_id": 91925701, "tag_name": "updream", "cover